
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ja">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport"
      content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>研究キーワード</title>

<style>
* {
  box-sizing: border-box;
}

body {
  margin: 0;
  min-height: 100vh;
  background: #f8f7f4;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  font-family:
    "Noto Sans JP", "Helvetica Neue",
    Arial, sans-serif;
  color: #303030;
}

.card {
  width: min(82%, 960px);
  padding: 60px;
  background: #fff;
  border: 2px solid #dedede;
  border-radius: 36px;
  box-shadow: 0 5px 12px rgba(0,0,0,.05);
}

h1 {
  margin: 0 0 36px;
  font-size: clamp(30px, 5.5vw, 64px);
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: .02em;
}

.tags {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 18px 22px;
}

.tag {
  display: inline-block;
  padding: 20px 36px;
  border: 2px solid #dedede;
  border-radius: 999px;
  background: white;
  font-size: clamp(16px, 3.5vw, 40px);
  line-height: 1.25;
  white-space: nowrap;
}

@media (max-width: 600px) {
  .card {
    width: 92%;
    padding: 24px 20px;
    border-radius: 24px;
  }

  h1 {
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  .tags {
    gap: 10px;
  }

  .tag {
    padding: 12px 16px;
    font-size: clamp(13px, 3.3vw, 20px);
  }
}
</style>
</head>

<body>
  <main class="card">
    <h1>研究キーワード</h1>

    <div class="tags">
      <span class="tag">格子ゲージ理論</span>
      <span class="tag">格子QCD</span>
      <span class="tag">有限温度QCD</span>
      <span class="tag">トポロジー</span>
      <span class="tag">カイラル対称性</span>
      <span class="tag">軸性U(1)対称性</span>
      <span class="tag">相構造</span>
      <span class="tag">機械学習</span>
      <span class="tag">計算物理</span>
      <span class="tag">量子計算</span>
      <span class="tag">高性能計算</span>
      <span class="tag">逆問題</span>
      <span class="tag">スパースモデリング</span>
      <span class="tag">JuliaQCD</span>
    </div>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
